---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Songs · CourtsAbove" description="Every CourtsAbove release and the meaning behind it, starting with our debut single Eternal Word." path="/songs/" current="songs">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="songs-h" style="position: relative; min-height: 600px; display: flex; align-items: stretch; overflow: hidden; background: #16191D">
<img src="/images/songs-hero.jpg" alt="Daniel Chin singing with his guitar inside a church" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 40%">
<div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,14,20,0.22) 0%, rgba(10,14,20,0.28) 50%, rgba(10,14,20,0.5) 100%)"></div>
<div class="heroin" style="position: relative; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 600px; padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 36px">
<figure style="margin: auto 0; max-width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<h1 id="songs-h" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em; text-align: center; color: #FFFFFF; text-shadow: 0 2px 28px rgba(10,14,20,0.45)"><span class="ql">Free for every church to sing.</span></h1>
</figure>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="intro-h" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-top: 104px; padding-bottom: 72px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; max-width: 680px">
<h2 id="intro-h" style="margin: 0 0 0 -0.055em; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.015em">Our Songs</h2>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="ew-h" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-bottom: 104px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: flex-start; padding-top: 56px; border-top: 1px solid #D9D6CE">
<img src="/images/eternal-word-cover.jpg" alt="Eternal Word single artwork" style="flex: 0 1 380px; min-width: 0; width: 100%; max-width: 380px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; display: block; border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(22,25,29,0.18)">
<div style="flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5A5F66">Single · 2026</p>
<h2 id="ew-h" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1">Eternal Word</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #5A5F66">Song credits: Daniel Chin</p>
</div>
<p class="dropcap" lang="en" style="margin: 0; max-width: 34em; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify; hyphens: auto; text-wrap: pretty">A strong reflection on the beginning chapter of the Gospel of John. In ‘Eternal Word’ written by Daniel Chin, the mystery and identity of Jesus Christ as the Word of God is explored. <em>Eternal Word</em> calls for a response from the listener: to trust in the promises of God, and to follow Christ to His Cross.</p>
<div class="songbtns" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding-top: 6px">
<a href="https://open.spotify.com/album/54NkoKS9BHUDUuUEyp94kJ" class="btn spbtn" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 22px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.02em; background: #16191D; color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #16191D"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M7.5 9.5c3-1 6.5-.7 9 .8"></path><path d="M8 12.6c2.5-.7 5.3-.4 7.3.8"></path><path d="M8.6 15.4c2-.5 4-.3 5.6.6"></path></svg><span>Listen on Spotify</span></a>
<a href="https://youtu.be/H4ZudKy-yEY" class="btn" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 22px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.02em; background: transparent; color: #16191D; border: 1px solid #16191D"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="5.5" width="19" height="13" rx="4"></rect><path d="M10 9.5v5l4.5-2.5z"></path></svg><span>Watch the Lyric Video</span></a>
<a href="/resources/" class="btn" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 22px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.02em; background: transparent; color: #16191D; border: 1px solid #16191D"><span>Resources</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
<style is:global>
.dropcap::first-letter{float:left;font-family:'Libre Baskerville',Baskerville,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:4.6em;line-height:0.82;padding:0.06em 0.14em 0 0;margin-right:0.04em;color:#2F5683}
.spbtn{transition:background-color .2s,border-color .2s,color .2s}
.spbtn:hover{filter:none !important;background:#1CB783 !important;border-color:#1CB783 !important;color:#FFFFFF !important}
@media (min-width: 760px){.ql{display:block;white-space:nowrap}}
@media (max-width: 760px){
.songbtns{gap:8px !important}
.songbtns a{padding:0 16px !important;gap:6px !important;font-size:14px !important;letter-spacing:0 !important;white-space:nowrap;min-height:44px !important}
.songbtns svg{width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0}
.menubtn{display:flex !important}
.navlinks{display:none !important}
.navlinks.open{display:flex !important;flex-basis:100%;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:0 !important;padding:4px 0 10px}
.hero,.heroin{min-height:460px !important}
.heroin{padding-top:88px !important;padding-bottom:40px !important}
.heroin figure{top:0 !important}
main section:not(.hero)[style*="padding-top"],main section:not(.hero) > div[style*="padding-top"]{padding-top:56px !important;padding-bottom:56px !important}
main h2[style*="clamp(3rem"]{font-size:2.5rem !important}
main h2[style*="clamp(2.6rem"]{font-size:2.2rem !important}
}
</style>
